+++ b/RUN40_SOURCE_INFO.txt	2026-08-30 15:11:19.486714519 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+RahYar Run 40
+Version: 1.5.6-prd-regression-fix
+VersionCode: 18
+Baseline: Run 39 / 1.5.5-field-test
+Regression contract: ItineraryStop, Poi, QuickSettings, PersonalPlace, RouteType LOW_TRAFFIC validity, CameraPadding.
+UI restoration: Home personal places + service shortcuts, navigation mid-route services entry, expanded Quick Settings.
+Fonts: embedded Persian IRANSans family resources recovered from verified Run38 APK baseline; no CI fallback substitution.
